B.SF=new A.dK("S","Stop","Whatever you are doing \u2014 stop. Let your hands be still. Nothing needs to happen for one minute.")
B.Su=new A.dK("T","Take a breath","One slow breath in through the nose\u2026 and a longer breath out. Then another. Feel the air.")
B.SD=new A.dK("O","Observe","What is here? A feeling \u2014 name it. A thought \u2014 see it as a thought. The body \u2014 where is it tight?")
B.SE=new A.dK("P","Proceed","Now choose. Not the habit's next move \u2014 yours. What would the witness do next?")
B.qs=s([B.SF,B.Su,B.SD,B.SE],t.iT)
B.fM=s([B.dv,B.d6,B.hE,B.hF,B.kd],t.QP)
B.qt=s([u.X,"Is it hot or cold? Tight or buzzing? Just describe it.","Breathe into the place where it lives. Let the breath surround it.","Notice: the urge is a sensation, not a command.","It is rising, or peaking, or already falling. Watch which.","You don't have to act and you don't have to fight. Only watch.","Every wave you ride without obeying makes the next one smaller.","What does the urge promise? Has it ever kept that promise?"],t.s)
