B.qv=s([u.H,"A thought arises. Don't follow it. Ask: to whom does this thought arise?",'The answer comes: "to me". Then ask \u2014 who am I?',"Not the body; the body is seen. Not the thoughts; the thoughts are known.","Who is it that knows? Turn attention back toward the one who is aware.","Don't answer with a thought. Just rest in the looking.","If the mind wanders, ask again, gently: to whom? Who am I?","Awareness is not something you do. It is what you are, before any doing.","Notice the silence between thoughts. Who notices it?","Rest as that."],t.s)
B.qw=s(["Recognize. What is here right now?","Allow. Let it be here. You don't have to like it. Just say: this belongs.","Investigate, with kindness. Where do you feel it in the body? What does it believe?","Nurture. What does this hurting part need to hear? Say it to yourself, as you would to a friend."],t.s)
